<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh inflation slows to 0.8 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Kazakh inflation slows to 0.8 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakh consumer price inflation slowed to 0.8 percent in March from 1.7 percent in February, the National Statistics Agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH CONSUMER PRICES     Mar 97  Feb 97  Mar 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change   +0.8    +1.7    +1.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change    +24.1   +25.2   +42.5</p>
<p>The government is forecasting a fall in annual inflation this year to about 17 percent from 28.7 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
